{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/TBInvestigation/posts/just-announced-special-agents-assigned-to-the-tennessee-bureau-of-investigations/1480589464093498/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/TBInvestigation/videos/just-announced-special-agents-assigned-to-the-tennessee-bureau-of-investigations/1087749564207341/","title":"45K views · 201 reactions | JUST ANNOUNCED: Special agents assigned to the Tennessee Bureau of Investigation’s Criminal Investigation Division have charged a Gainesboro man in connection to an ongoing child exploitation case.\n\nTo read more about this investigation, click the link in the comments section below. | Tennessee Bureau of Investigation","description":"JUST ANNOUNCED: Special agents assigned to the Tennessee Bureau of Investigation’s Criminal Investigation Division have charged a Gainesboro man in connection to an ongoing child exploitation case....","language":"en","text":"#MissingMonday We still need your help to locate Chad King, who remains the subject of a #TNSilverAlert.\nThe 41-year-old has been missing from Lebanon since October 28th, 2026.\nChad is 5'8\", 152 lbs., with brown hair and blue eyes. He was last seen in Nashville wearing a red shirt and blue jeans.\nIf you have seen Chad, please contact the Lebanon Police Department at 615-444-2323 or the TBI at 1-800-TBI-FIND.\nFor more details on this alert, TBI's Silver Alert program,\nand more resources, download the TBI Find App: tbi.pub/TBIFindApp","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":2385.8568720170297,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}